Package: oobase64
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: BASE64 ENCODER
 SIMD-accelerated RFC 4648 Base64 data encoder and decoder with URL-safe variants.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
